00:00:10.070 --> 00:00:14.879
Readers of the book will likely know from
the setting that it's a pretty serious day,

00:00:14.879 --> 00:00:17.359
so I don't think I'm gonna be messing around
too much with Nat and Cara today.

00:00:17.359 --> 00:00:20.160
Instead, let's talk about the Project for
Awesome.

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:22.170
Cara: Hiiiiiiii!

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:23.960
So Hank, the Project for Awesome -

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:26.050
C &amp;others: Hiiiiii!

00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:27.050
(laughter)

00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:28.680
So -
Hiiii!

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:29.680
so -
Hiiii!

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:30.680
so
Hiiii!

00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:33.300
So Hank, the Project for Awesome is a -
So Hank, the Project for Awesome is a

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:34.329
hiiiii!

00:00:34.329 --> 00:00:41.739
That's Nat Wolff, who plays Q in the movie,
and, um, John Lennon, who plays Margo Roth

00:00:41.739 --> 00:00:42.739
Spiegelman.

00:00:42.739 --> 00:00:46.220
